//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// COMMON MISTAKES
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*

1. WRONG GROUP NAME
MilitaryCamp ❌
Military_Camp ❌
MilitaryCamp ✔ (must match proto exactly)

-----------------------------

2. NO MATCHING PROTO ENTRY
If group doesn't exist in mapgroupproto.xml → nothing spawns

-----------------------------

3. OVERLAPPING SPAWNS
Too many groups at same coords → object clipping

-----------------------------

4. WRONG MAP COORDINATES
Outside map bounds → nothing appears

-----------------------------

5. EXPECTING HEIGHT CONTROL HERE
Y-axis is NOT controlled in pos here
Terrain handles height automatically
*/



//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// PERFORMANCE NOTES
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*
Too many groups can cause:

- server lag
- long restart times
- object desync

Best practice:
- reuse groups instead of duplicating designs
- avoid extreme density stacking
*/



